Notebook[{
Cell["\<\
V14 : Do I really need \[Xi] to make \[Chi](x)=0? NOOOO (POSITIVE)
&
 Can I have a LRW action without \[Phi]\[Psi] interaction??? That is, can I \
separate the propagation of \[Phi] and \[Psi] into an AND logic instead of \
the present OR logic? YESSS
 &
 Do I really want \[Chi](x)=0? NOOOO\
\>", "Text",
