Cell["\<\
Having separated \[Phi] and \[Psi] I can now have \[Psi] everywhere in the \
\[Gamma] term!?\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.951972396780592*^9, 3.951972414306528*^9}, {
