Cell["\<\
This is the True SARW action. Compared to the SAP one, this should just avoid \
itself without being conditioned to reach the target. 
The self-avoidance is implemented by the auxiliary \[Chi] field, which is \
just absorbed at the destination of the proposed move\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.951275096454464*^9, 3.9512751784178486`*^9}, {
  3.951275219648346*^9, 3.9512753040229015`*^9}, {3.9512753366525154`*^9, 
